What to redact
- Remove or mask all but the required digits (usually show just the last four: XXX-XX-3456).  
- Also remove the SSN from metadata, filenames, email subject lines, and from any other document fields (form metadata, OCR text layer).

How to redact safely (best practices)
- Use a proper redaction tool (recommended): these remove the text from the file rather than just hiding it visually.
  - Adobe Acrobat Pro: Tools → Redact → Mark for Redaction → Apply Redactions → Save as a new file. Confirm you cannot select the redacted text.
  - PDF editors with a “redact” feature work similarly.
- If you only have simple markup tools (that draw a black box), make sure to flatten or rasterize the page so the underlying text/OCR layer is removed:
