2) General rule: only give the full SSN when absolutely required and only over a secure channel. If the recipient only needs to verify identity, the last four digits are usually sufficient.

Practical guidance for sending a scanned form

- If you can avoid sending the full SSN, do so. Provide only the last 4 digits (e.g., ***-**-3456) or whatever last four you confirm.
