- Adobe Acrobat Pro: Tools → Redact → Mark for Redaction → Apply Redactions → Save as new file.
- Mac Preview: Mark up with black rectangles, then export as a flattened PDF and check for selectable text. (Preview isn’t a true redaction tool — verify carefully.)
- Free/PDF editors: Be cautious about online redaction tools (don’t upload to unknown services if the SSN is included).

