Key guidance and steps
- Prefer last 4 only: Ask the recipient if the last four digits will suffice. Many organizations (employers, banks, verifiers) only need the last 4; government forms sometimes require the full SSN.
- Ask how they want it: If they insist on the full SSN, ask for a secure upload portal or encrypted channel (not plain email).
- How to redact properly:
  - Use a proper redaction tool (Adobe Acrobat Pro, PDF redaction feature) that permanently removes the underlying text/data. Do NOT just draw a black box over selectable text in a PDF — the text can remain underneath.
