- Protect transmission:
  - Use the organization’s secure upload portal when available.
  - If emailing, password-protect the PDF and share the password separately (phone/text). Use strong passwords.
  - Consider using end-to-end encrypted email or a secure file-transfer service.
- Keep minimal copies: keep only what you must and delete any temporary/unneeded copies from devices and cloud storage.
- Log and confirm: once sent, confirm with the recipient that they received it and will securely delete any unnecessary copies.

