2) When to redact
- If the form or recipient only needs verification (many organizations accept just the last four), redact the first five digits and send only the last four.
- If the organization explicitly requires the full SSN, ask for a secure submission method (secure portal, encrypted upload) before sending.

3) Secure redaction methods (don’t use simple hiding)
- Do NOT rely on just covering text with a white box or cropping, or on annotation tools that can be undone. Those can leave the original text recoverable.
