- Remove metadata (file properties) if possible.
- Password-protect/encrypt the PDF and share the password by a different channel (e.g., text or phone call), or use the recipient’s secure upload portal.

5) Transmission safety
- Prefer secure portals, SFTP, encrypted email, or vendor-provided upload links.
- If you must email, use encrypted email and attach the redacted file; do not put SSN or last four in the subject line.

