Practical guidance and steps

1) What to show
- If the form/recipient only needs verification, provide only the last 4 digits (format example: XXX-XX-3456).  
- If they explicitly require the full SSN, ask for a secure upload or an encrypted delivery method before sending the full number.

2) How to redact correctly (don’t just hide it visually)
- Best (PDF): use a real redaction tool (Adobe Acrobat: Tools → Redact → Mark → Apply Redactions). This permanently removes the data.  
- Mac Preview: draw a black box, then Export → PDF and “Print” to a new PDF to flatten the image (verify the text is no longer selectable).  
- Windows/image: open in an editor (Paint, Photos), paint a solid black box over the digits, save as a new image, then convert to PDF if required. Do NOT rely on “hidden” layers — flatten/print to PDF.  
- Mobile: use a trusted redaction feature in a PDF app (Adobe Reader mobile, PDF Expert, etc.) and then save/export the flattened file.

