How to redact a document before scanning or sending
1. Best (digital redaction)
   - Open the PDF in a proper PDF editor (e.g., Adobe Acrobat Pro, PDFpen, Foxit).
   - Use the editor’s Redact tool (not just a black box drawing). Redaction removes the underlying text/data rather than hiding it.
   - Apply redaction to the SSN area, then use the “Sanitize” or “Remove hidden information” feature to clear metadata and hidden text.
