  [6] From: legal-compliance@corporate-governance-standards.com
      Subject: Standard Operating Procedure: Handling PII and Identity Document Queries
      Body length: 1021 chars
      Body (FULL):
This document outlines the Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) for handling user inquiries related to Personally Identifiable Information (PII). Relevant topics include: SSN, Social Security Number, passport, driver's license, identity documents, redaction, scanning forms, and obscuring sensitive data.

